Mitete ato wa nariyuki deshou

00:22:08.510 --> 00:22:11.940
Get your heart good and ready for this.
Kokoro no junbi wa chanto shitokou

00:22:14.610 --> 00:22:19.350
Do a sexy dance to the 8-beat rhythm.
eito biito yori mo sekushii dansu de

00:22:20.800 --> 00:22:23.110
Just like I thought it would,
omotta toori ni

00:22:23.690 --> 00:22:26.980
the angel's power exploded.
hajikete hora tenshi no pawaa

00:22:27.880 --> 00:22:28.710
Go go!
