It's party time until the break of dawn.
Party Time yo ga akeru made

00:22:44.270 --> 00:22:46.950
Party Time yo ga akeru made
It's party time until the break of dawn.

00:22:46.950 --> 00:22:50.940
The freedom of youth is here and now.
seishun no toki wa jiyuu na ima dake

00:22:51.570 --> 00:22:52.700
yeah yeah

00:22:53.120 --> 00:23:08.270
Go go!
Ike ike

00:23:17.400 --> 00:23:21.100
Sweets with feelings baked into them are wonderful, aren't they?

00:23:21.100 --> 00:23:23.840
Chocolates also transmit the warmth

00:23:23.840 --> 00:23:26.490
